%% title: SDD Mandate Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ACTIVE : registerMandate() — CORE scheme
    [*] --> PENDING_CONFIRMATION : registerMandate() — B2B scheme
    PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> ACTIVE : confirmMandate() — debtor bank confirms
    ACTIVE --> SUSPENDED : suspend()
    SUSPENDED --> ACTIVE : reactivate()
    ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : cancel() — by debtor or creditor
    SUSPENDED --> CANCELLED : cancel()
    PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> CANCELLED : cancel()
    ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : MandateExpiryScheduler\n(no collection > 36 months)
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]

    note right of ACTIVE
        lastCollectionDate updated on each collection.
        sequenceType advances FRST → RCUR → FNAL.
        Amendments recorded in JSON array.
    end note
